{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34378","headline":"袭美以公斋小宴见招因代书寄之 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美以公斋小宴见招因代书寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早云才破漏春阳，野客晨兴喜又忙。\n自与酌量煎药水，别教安置晒书牀。\n依方酿酒愁迟去，借样裁巾怕索将。\n唯待数般幽事了，不妨还入少年场。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}